.TH QUIPU-IMPORT 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-import \- Verify a share into quarantine, then promote or review it
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu import\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-source\fR] [\fB\-\-actor\fR] [\fB\-\-destination\fR] [\fB\-\-query\-namespace\fR] [\fB\-\-replace\-queries\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIshare\-dir\fR> [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Verify a share into quarantine, then promote or review it
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-source\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-actor\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-destination\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-query\-namespace\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-replace\-queries\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIshare\-dir\fR>

.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
quipu\-import\-delta(1)
Verify a delta share against its parent share
.TP
quipu\-import\-promote(1)
Promote a staged share into the store
.TP
quipu\-import\-review(1)
Review staged shares awaiting promotion
.TP
quipu\-import\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
